  volume    =  7,
  number    =  11,
  pages     = "e50180",
  abstract  = "We investigated in a rabbit model, the eye distribution of
               topically instilled benzalkonium\_(BAK) chloride a commonly used
               preservative in eye drops using mass spectrometry imaging. Three
               groups of three New Zealand rabbits each were used: a control one
               without instillation, one receiving 0.01\%BAK twice a day for 5
