              scaffold is required to provide mechanical function, balance must
              be achieved between optimizing porosity and maximizing mechanical
              strength. Supercritical CO(2) foaming can produce open-cell,
              interconnected structures in a low-temperature, solvent-free
              process. In this work, we report on foams of varying structural
