              culture (MC3T3-E1 cells). In the FRC cultures, maximal von Kossa
              staining was observed with 2.5 and 5 mM betaGP in the presence of
              100 microg/ml ascorbate. FRC cells also showed some von Kossa
              staining when cultured with bGP alone. In contrast, maximal von
              Kossa staining for MC3T3-E1 cells was observed with 10 mM betaGP.
