  abstract = "An automated platform has been developed for acquisition and
              visualization of mass spectrometry imaging (MSI) data using
              nanospray desorption electrospray ionization (nano-DESI). The new
              system enables robust operation of the nano-DESI imaging source
              over many hours by precisely controlling the distance between the
