  number    = "12-13",
  pages     = "960--965",
  abstract  = "An investigation of the calibration of the sample orientation
               with respect to the spectrometer input lens electron optical axis
               is reported using two proposed methods: the crystal axis method
               (CAM) and the overlayer thickness consistency method (OTCM). The
               study is conducted in a Kratos Axis Ultra X-ray photoelectron
