  volume   =  23,
  number   =  5,
  pages    = "599--602",
  abstract = "An analysis is made of the characteristics of monatomic primary
              ion sources to generate G-SIMS (gentle SIMS) spectra. In previous
              studies, this is resolved into the parameter beta that describes
              the relative intensities of ions in the series C(n)H(n+2-i) as i
