               uncertainties reduce to 0.05–0.25 nm or ∼1.4\% relative standard
               uncertainties. The best results achieve ∼1\% relative standard
               uncertainty. It is concluded that XPS has now been made fully
               traceable to the SI, for ultra-thin thermal SiO2 on Si layers, by
               calibration using wavelength methods in an approach that may be
