  volume    =  42,
  number    =  3,
  pages     = "129--138",
  abstract  = "An interlaboratory study involving 19 time-of-flight static
               secondary ion mass spectrometer (TOF-SSIMS) instruments from 12
               countries has been conducted. Analysts were supplied, by the
