               single exponential term dependent of the energy-deposition
               density, and the third is related to the cluster-binding energy.
               Finally, for studying molecular structure, the use of cluster
               primary ions in G-SIMS is outlined. Here, the cluster primary
               ions are critical for analyzing the weaker, high-mass peaks. ©
               Crown copyright 2010. Reproduced with the permission of Her
               Majesty's Stationery Office. Published by John Wiley \& Sons,
               Ltd.",
  month     =  jan,
