              labile biomolecules. Advantages of this analytical technique are
              high sensitivity, robustness, high-throughput capacity, and
              applicability to a wide range of compound classes. For some years,
              MALDI-MS has also been increasingly used for mass spectrometric
              imaging as well as in other areas of clinical research. Recently,
              several new concepts have been presented that have the potential
              to further advance the performance characteristics of MALDI. Among
