              tissues can be annotated on the basis of the MS profiles. The
              application of imaging MS-based molecular histology to larger
              tissue series, for clinical applications, requires significantly
              increased computational capacity in order to efficiently analyze
              the very large, highly dimensional datasets. Such datasets are
