               employed fingermark enhancement techniques (FET). In the present
               work a major point of interest concerned the sample treatment of
               FET visualised-lifted fingermarks and the subsequent MS
               performance of primary tape lifted fingermarks (“primary lifts”)
               versus secondary tape lifted fingermarks (recovery from the
               surface a second time following the initial primary lift). This
               was necessary since it may not always be possible to obtain
