  pages    = "e0163455",
  abstract = "Intratumoral genetic heterogeneity may impact disease outcome.
              Gold standard for dissecting clonal heterogeneity are single-cell
              analyses. Here, we present an efficient workflow based on an
              advanced Single-Cell Printer (SCP) device for the study of gene
