  number   =  11,
  pages    = "2058--2069",
  abstract = "In addition to mass accuracy, the ability of a mass spectrometer
              to faithfully measure the isotopic distribution of an ion, defined
              as spectral accuracy, is also important. Although time-of-flight
              mass spectrometers are reported to possess high spectral accuracy
