              was achieved using deuterated D(7)-FC and CE 17:0/CE 22:0 as
              internal standards as well as calibration lines generated by
              addition of FC and naturally occurring CE species to the
              respective sample matrix. The developed assay showed a precision
              and detection limit sufficient for routine analysis. A run time of
