  volume    =  23,
  number    =  3,
  pages     = "553--562",
  abstract  = "Effective temperatures of ions during traveling wave ion mobility
               spectrometry (TWIMS) analysis were measured using singly
               protonated leucine enkephalin dimer as a chemical thermometer by
               monitoring dissociation of the dimer into monomer, as well as the
