               established by the concept of systems biology. Within this
               context, metabolomics is one of the most powerful bioanalytical
               strategies that allow obtaining a picture of the metabolites of
               an organism in the course of a biological process, being
               considered as a phenotyping tool. Briefly, metabolomics approach
