              providing a simple and reliable method for extracting the relevant
              information from raw datasets. Copyright © 2016 John Wiley \&
              Sons, Ltd.",
  month    =  jun,
  year     =  2016,
  keywords = "wavelet transform, ToF-SIMS; molecular depth profiling; principal
              component analysis; polyelectrolytes"
}

@ARTICLE{Managh2016-rr,
