  abstract = "BACKGROUND: To prospectively evaluate an elastin-specific MR
              contrast agent (ESMA) for in vivo targeting of elastic fibers in
              myocardial infarction (MI) and postinfarction scar remodeling.
              METHODS AND RESULTS: MI was induced in C57BL/6J mice (n=40) by
              permanent ligation of the left anterior descending coronary
