               viability experiments indicated that blank APA-CPNPs possessed
               excellent biocompatibility with normal cells. Methotrexate (MTX)
               loaded APA-CPNPs have the same ability to inhibit cancer cells as
               free drug at high concentrations, while they are slightly weaker
