              from a clean film under bombardment with 40 keV C60 cluster
              projectiles is of the order of 10(-3), with some remaining
              uncertainty arising from laser-induced fragmentation and possible
              differences in the emission velocity distributions of neutral and
              ionized molecules. In general, this work establishes a method to
              estimate the ionization efficiency of molecular species sputtered
              during a single bombardment event. Graphical Abstract .",
