  number    =  3,
  pages     = "435--478",
  abstract  = "We review the literature that describes how (matrix-assisted)
               laser desorption/ionization (MA)LDI target plates can be used not
               only as sample supports, but beyond that: as functional parts of
               analytical protocols that incorporate detection by MALDI-MS or
