  volume    =  53,
  pages     = "268--278",
  abstract  = "Decellularized extracellular matrix (ECM) derived from tissues
               and organs are emerging as important scaffold materials for
               regenerative medicine. Many believe that preservation of the
               native ECM structure during decellularization is highly
