               collagen fibrils. CHP is a powerful new tool for direct and
               reliable measurement of denatured collagen molecules in
               decellularized tissues. It is expected to have wide applications
               in the development and standardization of the tissue/organ
               decellularization technology. STATEMENT OF SIGNIFICANCE:
