               the molecular denaturation of collagen in decellularized ECM
               enabled by a novel Collagen Hybridizing Peptide (CHP) that
               specifically binds to unfolded collagen chains. We show that SDS
               and Triton X-100 denature collagen molecules while CHAPS and SD
               cannot. Such detection has been nearly impossible with other
