  number   =  2,
  pages    = "155--191",
  abstract = "A method is reported for preparing, examining and analysing frozen
              hydrated tissue sections using transmission electron microscopy
              and X-ray microanalysis. Use of this method permits localization
              and measurement of water soluble or diffusible elements within the
              hydrated cell matrix. Since any change in total fresh weight of
