  author   = "Muramoto, Shin",
  journal  = "Analyst",
  volume   =  139,
  number   =  22,
  pages    = "5868--5878",
  abstract = "Time-of-flight secondary ion mass spectrometry (ToF-SIMS) was used
              to visualize the transport of analyte molecules desorbed onto a
              silicon wafer collection substrate by desorption electrospray
              ionization (DESI). The effect of spray incidence angle, tip
              height, and probe distance on the concentration and the spatial
