  number   =  22,
  pages    = "11084--11091",
  abstract = "The rapid development of metabolomics has significantly advanced
              health and disease related research. However, metabolite
              identification remains a major analytical challenge for untargeted
              metabolomics. While the use of collision cross-section (CCS)
              values obtained in ion mobility-mass spectrometry (IM-MS)
