               surface-immobilized antibodies. Since antibody orientation and
               spatial patterning remains important to antibody-based surface
               capture assays, TOF-SIMS imaging is useful to correlate
               immobilized biomolecule bioactivity. Patterned RGD peptides can
               also be imaged, and maintain high-fidelity cell patterns in
