              tissue enabled detection of most brain lipids (including neutral
              lipid species such as cerebrosides) more efficiently than
              traditional organic MALDI matrices. Herein, a similar implantation
              of 500 eV AgNP- across the entire heart tissue section results in
              a quick, reproducible, solvent-free, uniform matrix concentration
