  journal  = "Nat. Methods",
  volume   =  14,
  number   =  1,
  pages    = "90--96",
  abstract = "We report an atmospheric pressure (AP) matrix-assisted laser
              desorption/ionization (MALDI) mass spectrometry imaging (MSI)
              setup with a lateral resolution of 1.4 mu m, a mass resolution
              greater than 100,000, and accuracy below +/- 2 p.p.m. We achieved
