  journal  = "ACS Chem. Biol.",
  volume   =  9,
  number   =  9,
  pages    = "2149--2156",
  abstract = "Aberrant glycosylation is associated with most of the diseases.
              Direct imaging and profiling of N-glycans on tissue sections can
