              over the sections, spray-coating the tissue with matrix, and
              analyzing N-glycans by matrix-assisted laser desorption/ionization
              mass spectrometry (MALDI-MS). Brain sections from a C57BL/6 mouse
              were imaged using this technique at a resolution of 100 mu pm.
