              Jesse, Stephen and Van Berkel, Gary J",
  journal  = "ACS Nano",
  volume   =  9,
  number   =  4,
  pages    = "4260--4269",
  abstract = "The advancement of a hybrid atomic force microscopy/mass
              spectrometry imaging platform demonstrating the co-registered
