              regions and showed distinct spatial accumulation of the
              cholesterol tracer. CONCLUSIONSThe ability to couple stable
              isotope based protocols with MALDI-MSI enables a novel strategy to
              characterize the effects of therapeutic treatments on
              atherosclerotic plaque formation, regression and potential
