              matrix-assisted laser desorption electrospray ionization
              (IR-MALDESI) coupled to a Q Exactive Plus mass spectrometer was
              used to directly analyze 50-mu m thick slices of cucumber
              fermented and stored in 1 M sodium chloride brine. From the
              several hundred unique substances observed, three triterpenoid
