              reconstruction of sparse representation to improve resolution of
              MSI data. MethodsAir Flow-Assisted Ionization Mass Spectrometry
              Imaging (AFAI-MSI) was used to acquire MSI data from ink samples,
              thyroid tumour samples, rat renal biopsies, and rat brain biopsy
