              was adopted for the collected MSI data. ResultsAfter comparison of
              the reconstructed high-resolution image and the original
              high-resolution image, it is found that super-resolution
              reconstruction image is closer to the original high-resolution
              image than the image obtained with the interpolation method, and
              the highest Peak Signal-to-Noise Ratio (PSNR) difference value is
