              Salzet, Michel",
  journal  = "OMICS-A JOURNAL OF INTEGRATIVE BIOLOGY",
  volume   =  18,
  number   =  6,
  pages    = "374--384",
  abstract = "Matrix-assisted laser desorption ionization mass spectrometry
              imaging (MALDI-MSI) and profiling technology have become the
              easiest methods for quickly accessing the protein composition of a
              tissue area. Unfortunately, the demand for the identification of
              these proteins remains unmet. To overcome this bottleneck, we
