              MALDI profiling including on-tissue protein extraction using
              hexafluoroIsopropanol (1,1,1,3,3,3-hexafluoro-2-propanol, HFIP)
              coupled with two-dimensional cetyl trimethylammonium
              bromide/sodium dodecyl sulfate-polyacrylamide gel electrophoresis
              (2D CTAB/SDS-PAGE) for separation followed by trypsin digestion
