  journal  = "Molecules",
  volume   =  22,
  number   =  6,
  abstract = "Herbgenomics provides a global platform to explore the genetics
              and biology of herbs on the genome level. Panax ginseng C.A. Meyer
              is an important medicinal plant with numerous pharmaceutical
              effects. Previous reports mainly discussed the transcriptome of
              ginseng at the organ level. However, based on mass spectrometry
