  pages    = "711--717",
  abstract = "Endosperm tissue of cross-sectioned green arabica coffee beans was
              analyzed by the ambient ionization technique desorption
              electrospray ionization-mass spectrometry (DESI-MS) imaging and
              the spatial distribution of chlorogenic acids and sucrose across
