              hepatomegaly. There were no other significant findings including
              encephalitis or brain edema. Mass spectrometry analysis: To
              clarify the mechanism underlying lipid accumulation in the liver,
              matrix-assisted laser desorption/ionization imaging mass
              spectrometry (MALDI-IMS) analysis was conducted. This indicated a
