              glycolytic intermediates required for anabolic processes, in
              contrast to the slower growth rate of their corresponding
              CCR5(-/-)cells, that exhibit reduced glycolytic metabolism.
              Conclusions: These findings suggest that CCL5-CCR5 interactions in
