              and Gaylarde, Christine C and Beech, Iwona B",
  journal  = "Int. Biodeterior. Biodegradation",
  volume   =  125,
  pages    = "33--36",
  abstract = "A novel method to investigate penetration, distribution and
              metabolic effects of biocides in microbial biofilms is described.
              LASCA (laser ablation solvent capture by air flow) mass
              spectrometry imaging (MSI) allowed for the visualization of
              distributions of specific ion masses, including the signature of a
