              (N-(2-hydroxybenzyl)-2-(4-iodo-2,5-dimethoxyphenyl)
              ethan-1-aminium), however, GC-MS analysis of an blotter paper
              extract leads to incorrect results. In this work, we investigated
              whether easy ambient sonic-spray mass spectrometry imaging
              (EASI-IMS), and ambient ionization MS method can be applied
