              based on features of tissue revealed by mass spectrometry imaging",
  author   = "Pietrowska, Monika and Diehl, Hanna C and Mrukwa, Grzegorz and
              Kalinowska-Herok, Magdalena and Gawin, Marta and Chekan, Mykola
