              accuracy and reproducibility to demonstrate the anatomical
              distribution of 50 mu m diameter microdomains that show changes in
              brain ceramide levels in a rat model of controlled cortical impact
              (CCI) 3 days post injury with and without treatment. Adult male
              Sprague-Dawley rats received one strike and were euthanized 3 days
