               a Special Issue entitled: BBALIP\_Lipidomics Opinion Articles
               edited by Sepp Kohlwein.",
  month     =  mar,
  year      =  2017,
  keywords  = "Dynamic lipidomics; lipid metabolism; mass spectrometry; stable
