              desorption/ionization time-of flight mass spectrometry imaging
              (MALDI-MSI) of cryosections obtained from infected material. The
              results were confirmed by high-performance liquid
              chromatography/electrospray ionization triple quadrupole mass
              spectrometry (HPLC/MS/MS). ResultsThe mycotoxins ochratoxin A
              (OTA) and fumonisins of the B- and C-series (FB1, FB2, FB3, FB4,
