              cocaine toxicokinetics by liquid chromatography-mass spectrometry
              (LC-MS/MS) and found its rapid uptake into larvae. We used
              Matrix-assisted laser desorption ionization-mass spectrometry
              (MALDI-MS) imaging for the first time to characterize internal
              distribution of cocaine in zebrafish larvae. Surprisingly, eyes
