              identity of selected species. In addition to the high mass
              accuracy measurement, we were able to generate high spatial
              resolution (similar to 17 mu m) MS images of mouse brain sections.
              Our study demonstrated that utilization of dicationic compounds in
              the surface microextraction with the Single-probe device can
              perform high mass and spatial resolution ambient MSI measurements
