  volume    =  86,
  number    =  18,
  pages     = "9204--9211",
  abstract  = "The combination of mass spectrometry imaging and histology has
               proven a powerful approach for obtaining molecular signatures
               from specific cells/tissues of interest, whether to identify
               biomolecular changes associated with specific histopathological
               entities or to determine the amount of a drug in specific
               organs/compartments. Currently there is no software that is able
