               related metabolites 5-hydroxymethyl pirfenidone and 5-carboxy
               pirfenidone in lung, liver and kidney. To monitor the effect of
               pirfenidone administration on endogenous cell metabolism,
               additional in situ endogenous metabolite imaging was performed in
               lung tissue sections. While pirfenidone is highly abundant and
