              that the distribution of pituitary hormones such as prolactin
              (PRL), growth hormone (GH), adrenocorticotropic hormone (ACTH),
              and thyroid stimulating hormone (TSH) in both normal and tumor
              tissues can be assessed by using this approach. The presence of
