  journal  = "Anal. Bioanal. Chem.",
  volume   =  407,
  number   =  8,
  pages    = "2063--2071",
  abstract = "Three-dimensional (3D) imaging of tissue sections is a new
              frontier in mass spectrometry imaging (MSI). Here, we report on
              fast 3D imaging of lipids and metabolites associated with mouse
              uterine decidual cells and embryo at the implantation site on day
