  volume   =  377,
  pages    = "699--708",
  abstract = "A multi-modal mass spectrometry imaging (MSI) and profiling
              approach has been applied to assess the partitioning of the
              anti-TB fluoroquinolone levofloxacin into pulmonary lesions.
              Matrix-assisted laser desorption ionization mass spectrometry
              imaging (MALDI-MSI) and a commercial liquid microjunction surface
