              freely accessible for neurodegenerative diseases, such as
              Alzheimer's disease. It is thus important that new informatic
              analysis platforms are developed that allow the organization and
              interrogation of Big Data resources into a rational and actionable
              mechanism for advanced therapeutic development. This will entail
