  number    =  9,
  pages     = "e0136902",
  abstract  = "Formalin-fixed paraffin-embedded (FFPE) tissue specimens
               constitute a highly valuable source of clinical material for
               retrospective molecular studies. However, metabolomic assessment
               of such archival material remains still in its infancy. Hence,
               there is an urgent need for efficient methods enabling extraction
