  abstract = "11β-Hydroxysteroid dehydrogenase 1 (11β-HSD1; EC 1.1.1.146)
              generates active glucocorticoid hormones. Small molecule
              inhibitors have been developed to target 11β-HSD1 for the
              treatment of dementia; these must enter brain subregions, such as
