  author   = "Choi, Yoon Kyung and Oh, Joo Yeon and Han, Sang Yun",
  journal  = "J. Am. Soc. Mass Spectrom.",
  abstract = "Due to the known sweet-spot issues that intrinsically arise from
              inhomogeneous formation of matrix-analyte crystals utilized as
              samples in matrix-assisted laser desorption ionization (MALDI)
              mass spectrometry, its reproducibility and thus its applications
              for quantification have been somewhat limited. In this paper, we
