              optically uniform MALDI sample crystal layers on the film
              surfaces. Further, mass spectrometric imaging reveals that the
              visible uniformity is indeed accompanied by reproducible MALDI
              ionization over an entire sample spot, which greatly suppresses
              the appearance of sweet spots. The results of this study confirm
              that the proposed method achieves good linear responses of ion
              intensity to the analyte concentration (R2 > 0.99) with small
              relative standard deviations (σ < 10\%), which is a range
