              enhancing pre-clinical efficacy and toxicity evaluation and
              prediction. Whilst capturing cellular phenotype via imaging in
              response to drug exposure is a useful readout in these models,
              application has been limited due to difficulties in imaging the
              chips at scale. Here we created an end-to-end, automated workflow
