  journal  = "Methods",
  volume   =  151,
  pages    = "21--27",
  abstract = "With mass spectrometry imaging (MSI) on tissue microarrays (TMAs)
              a large number of biomolecules can be studied for many patients at
              the same time, making it an attractive tool for biomarker
              discovery. Here we investigate whether lymph node metastasis can
              be predicted from MALDI-MSI data. Measurements are performed on
