              biomarker discovery for histological grading of human bladder
              cancers by MSI. We therefore submitted formalin-fixed
              paraffin-embedded tissues from 14 bladder cancer patients with
              varying histological grades to 3D analysis by matrix-assisted
              laser desorption/ionization (MALDI) MSI. We found that, after
              removing 20\% of the data based on novel outlier detection
              routines for 3D-MSI data based on the evaluation of digestion
