  number   =  2,
  pages    = "185--191.e4",
  abstract = "Visualization algorithms are fundamental tools for interpreting
              single-cell data. However, standard methods, such as t-stochastic
              neighbor embedding (t-SNE), are not scalable to datasets with
              millions of cells and the resulting visualizations cannot be
              generalized to analyze new datasets. Here we introduce net-SNE, a
