              and PG as sources. BMP has an unusual stereoconfiguration which is
              responsible for its slow catabolism. It is localized exclusively
              in the inner membranes of late endosomes, and mostly, lysosomes.
              BMP is negatively charged at the acidic pH of lysosomes, and these
