  journal  = "Anal. Chem.",
  abstract = "In this work a combination of routine clinical practice and
              state-of-the-art laser ablation-inductively coupled plasma
              time-of-flight mass spectrometry (LA-ICP-TOFMS) imaging is
              presented for multi-element analysis of single cells on clinical
              samples. More specifically, routinely drawn blood thin films of a
