  pages    = "2257--2269",
  abstract = "Stem cells are influenced by various factors present in their in
              vivo microenvironment, such as interactions with neighboring
              cells, the extracellular matrix or soluble molecules. This
              demonstrates the high complexity of the in vivo microenvironment.
              Hence, many advances have been made in developing 3D screening
