  journal  = "J. Thorac. Oncol.",
  volume   =  14,
  number   =  11,
  pages    = "1935--1947",
  abstract = "BACKGROUND: Tumor mutational burden (TMB) is an emerging biomarker
              used to identify patients who are more likely to benefit from
              immuno-oncology therapy. Aside from various unsettled technical
              aspects, biological variables such as tumor cell content and
              intratumor heterogeneity may play an important role in determining
