  abstract = "BACKGROUND: Cancer cells must alter their metabolism to support
              proliferation. Immune evasion also plays a role in supporting
              tumour progression. This study aimed to find whether enhanced
              glutamine uptake in breast cancer (BC) can derive the existence of
              specific immune cell subtypes, including the subsequent impact on
