              finer level of process control. In this study, we use Raman
              spectroscopy as an in-line optical sensor for bioprocess
              monitoring of an autologous T-cell immunotherapy model produced in
              a stirred tank bioreactor system. Using reference datasets
              generated on a standard bioanalyzer, we develop chemometric models
