               which, apart from the accurate mass and MS/MS data, the number of
               exchangeable protons in (un)known molecules is obtained. While
               eventually presenting ambient HDX-LAESI-MSI, samples were not
               preincubated with deuterated solvents, but instead HDX occurred
               following fusion of ablated sample material with microdroplets
               generated by ESI of deuterated solvents. Therefore, the degree of
               HDX was first studied following ablation of nondeuterated sample
