              [0·96-1·09], p=0·46). The increase in TILs was also associated
              with longer overall survival in TNBC (0·92 [0·86-0·99], p=0·032),
              but had no association in HER2-positive breast cancer (0·94
              [0·86-1·02], p=0·11), and was associated with shorter overall
              survival in luminal-HER2-negative tumours (1·10 [1·02-1·19],
              p=0·011). INTERPRETATION: Increased TIL concentration predicted
