               two methods: Images were recorded with the individual rows
               alternating between EASI and DESI, yielding a separate image for
               each technique recorded under perfectly similar conditions on the
               same sample. EASI works reliably for imaging of all samples, but
               the choice of spray solvent and flow rate is more critical in
