              cycle metabolites (α-ketoglutarate, malic acid, and glutamate) in
              frozen and FFPE tissues specimens. In addition, by employing
              chiral derivatization in the sample preparation, the platform
              enabled separation and determination of 2HG enantiomers (D- and
