              desorption/ionization mass spectrometry imaging to analyze the
              spatial distribution of N-linked glycans on an MLS microarray in
              order to identify molecular markers for tumor progression.
              Comparison of the N-glycan profiles revealed that increased
              relative abundances of high-mannose type glycans were associated
              with tumor progression. Concomitantly, an increase of the average
              number of mannoses on high-mannose glycans was observed. Although
