              vivo lipidomic changes upon MYC induction across different
              cancers, for example, a global increase in
              glycerophosphoglycerols. After inhibition of FA synthesis,
              tumorigenesis was blocked, and tumors regressed in both xenograft
              and primary transgenic mouse models, revealing the vulnerability
              of MYC-induced tumors to the inhibition of lipogenesis.",
