  volume    =  31,
  number    =  9,
  pages     = "1844--1853",
  abstract  = "A recently introduced technique based on MALDI with laser-induced
               postionization (PI), also named MALDI-2, increases the ion yields
               for numerous classes of lipids, metabolites, and carbohydrates in
               MALDI-MS imaging experiments under certain experimental
               conditions. Here, we used a semiautomatic LabVIEW-based protocol
