  volume   =  10,
  number   =  9,
  abstract = "The metabolic characteristics of metastatic and non-metastatic
              breast carcinomas remain poorly studied. In this work, untargeted
              Nuclear Magnetic Resonance (NMR) metabolomics was used to compare
              two medroxyprogesterone acetate (MPA)-induced mammary carcinomas
              lines with different metastatic abilities. Different metabolic
