              compared to non-metastatic tumours. This study shows the valuable
              contribution of untargeted NMR metabolomics to characterise tumour
              metabolism, thus opening enticing opportunities to find metabolic
              markers related to metastatic ability in endocrine breast cancer.",
  month    =  aug,
  year     =  2020,
  keywords = "NMR; endocrine breast cancer; hormone-independent growth;
