  journal  = "Anal. Chem.",
  abstract = "Breast cancer is an umbrella term used to describe a collection of
              different diseases with broad inter- and intra-tumor
              heterogeneity. Understanding this variation is critical in order
              to develop, and precisely prescribe, new treatments. Changes in
              the lipid metabolism of cancerous cells can provide important
