  volume   =  133,
  number   =  11,
  pages    = "1513--1522",
  abstract = "Competitive host-guest chemistry on a desorption electrospray
              ionization mass spectrometry (DESI MS) platform is presented here
              as the basis for a rapid and quantitative screening method for
              assessing the quality of Tamiflu capsules with minimal sample
              preparation. Oseltamivir, the active ingredient in Tamiflu, is an
