              spatial distribution patterns of lipids, peptides, and proteins in
              biological tissue sections. In this work, we demonstrate an
              application of multimodal chemical imaging using matrix-assisted
              laser desorption/ionization mass spectrometry (MALDI-MS), which
              provided comprehensive molecular information in situ within the
              same mouse heart tissue sections with myocardial infarction.
              MALDI-IMS (at 30 μm per pixel) revealed infarct-associated spatial
