  number    = "16 Supplement",
  pages     = "1203--1203",
  abstract  = "Proceedings: AACR Annual Meeting 2020; April 27-28, 2020 and June
               22-24, 2020; Philadelphia, PA Background: Testicular germ cell
               tumors (TGCT) are the most common cancers in young men of
               European ancestry aged 20 to 39 years. The incidence of TGCT has
