  abstract = "BACKGROUND: Gene set enrichment (GSE) analysis is a popular
              framework for condensing information from gene expression profiles
              into a pathway or signature summary. The strengths of this
              approach over single gene analysis include noise and dimension
              reduction, as well as greater biological interpretability. As
