              model pathway activity within highly heterogeneous data sets.
              RESULTS: To address this challenge, we introduce Gene Set
              Variation Analysis (GSVA), a GSE method that estimates variation
              of pathway activity over a sample population in an unsupervised
              manner. We demonstrate the robustness of GSVA in a comparison with
