              viable cancer subregions; (2) the absence of the ion of m/z 391.25
              which is present in small abundance only in viable cancer
              subregions; and (3) a slight increase in the relative intensity of
              known breast cancer biomarker ions of m/z 281.25 [FA(18:1)-H]- and
              303.23 [FA(20:4)-H]-. Necrosis is accompanied by alterations in
              the tissue optical depolarization rate, allowing tissue
