  journal  = "Cell Rep.",
  volume   =  28,
  number   =  3,
  pages    = "819--831.e4",
  abstract = "The success of immunotherapy has led to a myriad of clinical
              trials accompanied by efforts to gain mechanistic insight and
              identify predictive signatures for personalization. However, many
              immune monitoring technologies face investigator bias, missing
              unanticipated cellular responses in limited clinical material. We
              present here a mass cytometry (CyTOF) workflow for standardized,
              systems-level biomarker discovery in immunotherapy trials. To
