  journal  = "Proc. Natl. Acad. Sci. U. S. A.",
  volume   =  93,
  number   =  7,
  pages    = "3155--3160",
  abstract = "Mutations in the human Cu,Zn superoxide dismutase gene (SOD1) are
              found in 20\% of kindreds with familial amyotrophic lateral
              sclerosis. Transgenic mice (line G1H) expressing a human SOD1
              containing a mutation of Gly-93 --> Ala (G93A) develop a motor
              neuron disease similar to familial amyotrophic lateral sclerosis,
