              researchers to interactively navigate through the gene-triaging
              framework. Mantis-ml is an intuitive tool that supports the
              objective triaging of large-scale genomic discovery studies and
              enhances our understanding of complex genotype-phenotype
              associations.",
  month    =  may,
  year     =  2020,
  keywords = "auto-ML; gene-prioritization; genomics; keras; machine-learning;
