  journal       = "arXiv [cs.CY]",
  abstract      = "Objective: The exchange of health-related data is subject to
                   regional laws and regulations, such as the General Data
                   Protection Regulation (GDPR) in the EU or the Health
                   Insurance Portability and Accountability Act (HIPAA) in the
                   United States, resulting in non-trivial challenges for
