              target mutant KRAS directly, most therapeutic approaches focus on
              downstream pathways, albeit with limited efficacy. Moreover,
              mutant KRAS alters the basal metabolism of cancer cells,
              increasing glutamine utilization to support proliferation. We show
              that concomitant mutation of Apc and Kras in the mouse intestinal
