               MALDI MS since this is widely considered as the most serious
               drawback of the method. Although the detailed role of the matrix
               is not yet completely understood, it will be explicitly shown
               that the careful choice of the matrix is crucial (besides the
               careful evaluation of the positive and negative ion mass spectra)
