              also a member of the NanoString SAB. In the last five years the
              Sorger lab has received research funding from Novartis and Merck.
              KLL is supported by Eli Lilly and BMS, consults for BMS,
              Integragen, Travera LLC, is on the SAB of Integragen and Rarecyte,
              and holds equity in Travera LLC. PB receives grant funding from
