              network-based annotation. Specifically, for cancer-associated cell
              types, we put regulators into hierarchies and measure their
              network change (rewiring) during oncogenesis. We also extensively
              survey TF-RBP crosstalk, highlighting how SUB1, a previously
              uncharacterized RBP, drives aberrant tumor expression and
