               were not prognostic of disease-free survival (DFS) for
               oropharyngeal (p=0.98) nor lung (p=0.15) cancer, and deep
               learning was prognostic of DFS for lung (p=0.03) but not for
               oropharyngeal cancer (p=0.26). SpaCell was not only prognostic
               for both cancer types but also provides more explainability in
               terms of tumor biology.",
  month     =  apr,
  year      =  2023,
  keywords  = "tumor microenvironment; non-small cell lung cancer;
               HPV-associated oropharyngeal squamous cell carcinoma; prognostic
