  pages     = "391--402",
  abstract  = "The potential to use quantitative image analysis and artificial
               intelligence is one of the driving forces behind digital
               pathology. However, despite novel image analysis methods for
               pathology being described across many publications, few become
               widely adopted and many are not applied in more than a single
