  pages    = "2021.06.03.444997",
  abstract = "White adipose tissue (WAT) plays a central role in metabolism,
              with multiple diseases and genetic mutations causing its
              remodeling. Quantitative analysis of white adipocyte size is of
              great interest to understand physiology and disease, but previous
              studies of H\&E histology have been limited to a subsample of
