               that mean adipocyte area positively correlated with body mass
               index (BMI) (Psubq = 8.13 × 10-69, βsubq = 0.45; Pvisc = 2.5 ×
               10-55, βvisc = 0.49; average R2 across cohorts = 0.49) and that
