              influenced by the tumor, and how the profile compares with
              non-tumor-bearing tissues. Here, we integrate data from the
              Genotype-Tissue Expression project and The Cancer Genome Atlas to
              comprehensively analyze the transcriptomes of healthy, NAT, and
              tumor tissues in 6506 samples across eight tissues and
