  abstract = "Spatial tissue proteomics combining microscopy-based cell
              phenotyping with ultrasensitive mass spectrometry (MS) based
              proteomics is an emerging and powerful concept for the study of
              cell function and heterogeneity in health and disease. However,
              optimized workflows that preserve morphological information for
              image-based phenotype discovery and maximize proteome coverage of
