  author   = "Leite, Sofia Batista and Brooke, Matthew and Carusi, Annamaria and
              Collings, Andy and Deceuninck, Pierre and Dechamp, Jean-François
              and Dekker, Bronwen and De Ranieri, Elisa and Ganley, Emma and
