              the complexity, size and heterogeneity of the underlying
              information. RESULTS: In this work, we present the Scalable
              Precision Medicine Open Knowledge Engine (SPOKE), a biomedical KG
              connecting millions of concepts via semantically meaningful
              relationships. SPOKE contains 27 million nodes of 21 different
              types and 53 million edges of 55 types downloaded from 41
              databases. The graph is built on the framework of 11 ontologies
              that maintain its structure, enable mappings and facilitate
