  abstract = "Highlights We have developed an automated data processing pipeline
              to quantify mouse and human data from patient-derived xenograft
              samples assayed by Visium spatial transcriptomics with matched
              hematoxylin and eosin (H\&E) stained image. We enable
              deconvolution of reads with Xenome, quantification of spatial gene
