  volume   =  14,
  number   =  3,
  pages    = "307--317",
  abstract = "Background: Topical 5-Fluorouracil (5-FU) exhibits suboptimal
              efficacy for non-melanoma skin cancer, attributed to insufficient
              intracutaneous penetration. This study investigates the impact of
              ablative fractional laser (AFXL) at different laser-channel depths
