               alkaline pH and the effect was followed by gel filtration,
               SDS/PAGE, UV-visible spectrophotometry, electrospray-ionization
               MS, multiangle laser light scattering and transmission electron
               microscopy. The analysis of Arenicola haemoglobin dissociation
