  abstract = "The methodology for designing a multicolumns recirculated packed
              bed batch reactor (MRPBR) system is developed. The performance of
              the system employing immobilized penicillin-G amidase (IPGA) for
              the production of 6-APA is studied. The total IPGA activity in the
              cyclic operated MRPBR system is maintained within a constant range
