  number   =  2,
  pages    = "869--873",
  abstract = "Bifidobacterium longum KCTC 3128 and HLC 3742 were independently
              immobilized (entrapped) in calcium alginate beads containing 2, 3,
              and 4\% sodium alginate. When the bifidobacteria entrapped in
              calcium alginate beads were exposed to simulated gastric juices
              and a bile salt solution, the death rate of the cells in the beads
