  volume   =  82,
  number   =  1,
  pages    = "47--53",
  abstract = "Glucose-sensitive hydrogel membranes have been synthesized and
              characterized for their rate-of-delivery of macromolecules. The
              mechanism for changing this rate is based on variable displacement
              of the affinity interaction between dextran and concanavalin A
              (con A). Our main objective was to characterize the diffusion of
