  number   =  2,
  pages    = "271--280",
  abstract = "The aim of this investigation was to determine the effect of
              growth factor treatment on ovine meniscal chondrocyte (OMC)
              proliferation in vitro and on the production of matrix proteins by
              OMCs grown within a polyglycolic acid (PGA) scaffold. Analysis of
