  journal  = "J. Food Sci.",
  volume   =  72,
  number   =  1,
  pages    = "M31--M37",
  abstract = "The aim of this study was to investigate the effect of whey
              protein isolate (WPI) gel microentrapment on the viability of
              Lactobacillus rhamnosus R011 during the production and storage of
              biscuits, frozen cranberry juice, and vegetable juice. Viability
              of microentrapped (ME) cells was compared to free cells
              freeze-dried in a milk-based protective solution as well as in a
