  number    =  12,
  pages     = "3877--3888",
  abstract  = "The Galalpha1,3Galbeta1,4GlcNAc-R (Gal) epitope is a major factor
               in the hyperacute rejection of pig organ transplants in primates.
               Biologic scaffold materials used for tissue reconstruction and
               composed of xenogeneic extracellular matrix (ECM) may contain the
