  journal   = "Cell Biol. Int.",
  publisher = "Elsevier Ltd",
  volume    =  33,
  number    =  11,
  pages     = "1184--1193",
  abstract  = "We have successfully developed both spontaneous and inductive
               cardiomyocyte differentiation of iPS cells reprogrammed from
               human foreskin fibroblasts. The reprogrammed iPS cells
               morphologically resemble human cardiomyocytes which can beat.
               RT-PCR and immunostaining show that cardiac markers are expressed
