  journal  = "Biochemistry",
  volume   =  48,
  number   =  29,
  pages    = "6876--6886",
  abstract = "We have determined transmembrane protein tyrosine phosphorylation
              (outside-in signaling) in cultured osteoclasts and macrophages in
