  journal  = "Am. J. Pathol.",
  volume   =  174,
  number   =  3,
  pages    = "1109--1119",
  abstract = "Advanced valvular lesions often contain ectopic mesenchymal
              tissues, which may be elaborated by an unidentified multipotent
              progenitor subpopulation within the valve interstitium. The
              identity, frequency, and differentiation potential of the putative
              progenitor subpopulation are unknown. The objectives of this study
