  journal  = "Arch. Med. Res.",
  volume   =  40,
  number   =  5,
  pages    = "339--344",
  abstract = "BACKGROUND AND AIMS: We undertook this study in order to
              investigate the electrophysiological properties of grafted mouse
              embryonic stem cell (ES)-derived cardiomyocytes in mouse hearts.
              METHODS: We generated transgenic D3 ES cells that carry the
              alpha-myosin heavy-chain promoter-driven enhanced green
