  journal  = "J. Tissue Eng. Regen. Med.",
  abstract = "A new scaffold fabrication technique aiming to enhance pore
              interconnectivity for tissue engineering has been developed.
              Medical grade poly(lactic acid) was utilized to generate scaffolds
              by a solvent-evaporating/particulate-leaching technique, using a
              new dual-porogen system. Water-soluble sodium chloride particles
