               of polyatomic ion beams such as C60, Time-of-Flight-SIMS
               (ToF-SIMS) depth profiling analysis is now able to provide
               information about the protein-substrate interface chemistry. To
               investigate this effect, two types of films, bovine serum albumin
               (BSA) onto hydrophilic silicon wafer, and BSA onto hydrophobic
