               exhibited a more differentiated phenotype on the stiffest surface
               indicated by elevated osteocalcin compared with TCPS. Conversely,
               cells on 2HEMA-PEGDMA copolymers became more differentiated on
               the less stiff 2HEMA surface. Growth factors were regulated in a
               differential manner. These results indicate that copolymer
