              sense these mechanical cues is converted into elicited cellular
              responses. Musculoskeletal mechanobiology is of particular
              interest given the high mechanical loads that musculoskeletal
              tissues experience on a daily basis. How do cells within these
              mechanically active tissues interpret external loads imposed on
