              contamination, labor intensiveness, and variability in
              experimental results in hPSC cultures. Toward addressing some of
              these concerns, we report the propagation of three different hPSCs
              on feeder-free extracellular matrix (ECM)-based substrates derived
              from human fibroblasts. hPSCs propagated in this setting were
