              spherical, interconnected pores that enhance angiogenesis while
              reducing scarring. Surface-modified scaffolds were seeded with
              human ES cell-derived cardiomyocytes and cultured in vitro.
              Cardiomyocytes survived and proliferated for 2 wk in scaffolds,
