               micropatterned indium tin oxide (ITO) surfaces. Fabrication of
               the micropatterns involved multiple steps including self-assembly
               of poly (ethylene glycol) (PEG)-silane, patterning of
               photoresist, treatment with oxygen plasma and adsorption of
