              aggregates were studied with light microscopy. The minerals'
              formation in the form of nodules produced by the cell aggregates
              and the bone crystal quality were studied with Fourier Transform
              Infrared (FTIR) spectroscopy. The FTIR spectra of the ash
              specimens (mineral phase only) from thermal gravimetric analysis
              (TGA) provided valuable information of the quality of the
