  journal  = "Cardiovasc. Pathol.",
  volume   =  12,
  number   =  4,
  pages    = "186--194",
  abstract = "Osteonectin and osteopontin, two secreted matricellular proteins,
              have a variety of functions that are exerted through interaction
              with matrix components. These proteins appear in response to
              tissue injury. To test our hypothesis that osteopontin and
              osteonectin are expressed with spatially and temporally different
