  volume    =  300,
  number    =  5616,
  pages     = "105--108",
  abstract  = "We have identified six circumstellar silicate grains within
               interplanetary dust particles (IDPs). Their extrasolar origins
               are demonstrated by their extremely anomalous oxygen isotopic
               compositions. Three 17O-rich grains appear to originate from red
               giant or asymptotic giant branch stars. One 16O-rich grain may be
