              human fetal cardiomyocytes. METHODS AND RESULTS: hES cells were
              cocultured with visceral-endoderm (VE)-like cells from the mouse.
              This initiated differentiation to beating muscle. Sarcomeric
              marker proteins, chronotropic responses, and ion channel
              expression and function were typical of cardiomyocytes.
