  volume    =  76,
  number    =  11,
  pages     = "3199--3207",
  abstract  = "The feasibility of using cluster secondary ion mass spectrometry
               for depth profiling of drug delivery systems is explored. The
               behavior of various biodegradable polymer films under dynamic
               SF(5)(+) primary ion bombardment was investigated, including
               several films doped with model drugs. The SF(5)(+) depth profiles
