  journal  = "J. Med. Invest.",
  volume   =  53,
  number   = "3-4",
  pages    = "297--302",
  abstract = "Dental pulp cells have a capacity to differentiate into
              mineralization-inducing cells. To clarify the molecular mechanism,
              we established an in vitro mineralization-inducing system by rat
              clonal dental pulp cell line, RPC-C2A, and tried to purify a
              mineralization-inducing factor in conditioned medium (CM) from
              pre-osteoblastic MC3T3-E1 cells. The active factor was impermeable
