  volume   =  126,
  number   =  2,
  pages    = "111--121",
  abstract = "Chemical images of the surfaces and the interiors of coatings of
              rapamycin in poly(lactic-co-glycolic acid) (PLGA) obtained by mass
              spectrometry and light scattering methods reveal a three
              dimensional picture of the chemical morphology of drug eluting
