  volume    =  24,
  number    =  24,
  pages     = "13819--13821",
  abstract  = "Fixed fibronectin-coated gold surfaces with and without adherent
               embryonic fibroblasts were probed via vibrational
               sum-frequency-generation (SFG) spectroscopy. The SFG spectra were
               compared to infrared reflection-absorption spectroscopy (IRRAS)
               data in the CH stretching region. Noticeable differences were
               observed in the IRRAS spectra of the samples, whereas SFG spectra
