               typically required osteogenic supplement dexamethasone. However,
               since dexamethasone antagonizes TNF-α, the interplay of ECM and
               TNF-α was investigated by culturing naïve MSCs on the
               decellularized scaffolds in the absence of dexamethasone. MSCs
               cultured on ECM-coated scaffolds continued to deposit mineralized
               matrix, a late stage marker of osteogenic differentiation.
