               nuclear magnetic resonance spectroscopy (NMR). The copolymers
               were then adsorbed on Nb2O5 surfaces. Optical waveguide lightmode
               spectroscopy method was used to monitor the surface adsorption in
               situ of these copolymers and provide information on adlayer
