               expression compared to hMSC ECM from CM and PCL scaffolds without
               ECM incorporation. No significant influence of hMSC ECM presence
               on the chondrogenic signature of OA chondrocytes was found. The
               influence of decellularized hMSC ECM on HL chondrocytes suggests
